  "description": "JOYSTAR Fantasy Girls' Bike - Sizes 12\" to 20\"\nWatch her dreams take flight with the JOYSTAR Fantasy Girls' Bike. Perfectly blending vintage aesthetics with robust performance, this bike is built for girls aged 2-13 to develop balance, coordination, and a lifelong love for cycling.\n\nTimeless style meets modern safety: The JOYSTAR Fantasy in Mint Green.\n\nPerformance & Safety Engineering\n\"Designed for a lifetime of adventure, the Fantasy features a durable frame and a dual-brake system that grows with your child's skill level.\"\nSuperior Safety Systems\nThe JOYSTAR Fantasy is built with a high-tensile HI-TEN steel frame, providing incredible durability for years of play. To ensure maximum control, it features a dual-braking system: a front caliper hand brake and a rear coaster brake. This setup helps children transition from foot-braking to hand-braking with ease.\n\nStable handling and reliable stopping power for every adventure.\n\nKey Features & Benefits\n\nGrowth-Ready: Features an adjustable seat post and handlebars to accommodate your child's growth spurts.\n\nFull Chain Guard: Keeps fingers safe and prevents grease from getting on clothing.\n\nStable Ride: 2.125\" wide pneumatic rubber tires provide extra grip on sidewalks and paths.\n\nVintage Touches: Comes complete with a front woven basket, DIY decals, and a classic bike bell.\n\nQuick & Easy Assembly\nWe value your time. The JOYSTAR Fantasy arrives 85% pre-assembled. All necessary tools and simple instructions are included, allowing you to get the bike ready for the road in approximately 20 minutes.\n\nEasy Setup: Get your JOYSTAR Fantasy ready for the sidewalk in minutes.\n\nSize Chart & Fit Guide\n\nTraining Wheels & Kickstand, Basket, Bell, DIY Decals\n\nSee It In Action\n\nWatch: A father helps his daughter master her Pink Fantasy 14-inch bike.\n\nOur Guarantee\nJOYSTAR provides a competitive warranty structure that rivals premium brands to give you total peace of mind:\n\nThe Frame (Lifetime): Steel and aluminum frames are guaranteed against faulty materials and workmanship for as long as the original purchaser owns the bicycle.\n\nThe Components (2 Years): Most non-wear parts (such as the handlebars, fork, and crankset) are covered for 2 years against manufacturing defects.\n\nRegistration Bonus: While the standard warranty is robust, JOYSTAR often extends a Limited Lifetime Warranty to the original owner if the bike is registered on our official website shortly after purchase.",
